# ================================================================ crm
### crm.get_status
GET {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/crm/status
X-Service-Key: {{service_key}}

### crm.list_events
GET {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/crm/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### crm.receive_event
POST {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/crm/events
X-Service-Key: {{service_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### crm.retry_event
POST {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/crm/events/1/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

# ================================================================ health
### health.get_health
GET {{base}}/api/v1/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

