{}

# ================================================================ admin & security (S6): examples with bodies
### integrations.list_statuses (any signed-in user: Verified / Pending Verification / Integration Unavailable)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### integrations.update (Super Admin, fresh auth; Verified needs Configured + evidence)
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/integrations/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"configuration_status": "Configured", "verification_status": "Verified", "evidence": "Test meeting created for NIT-GNT on 30 Sep"}

### security_controls.update
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/security-controls/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"verification_status": "Verified", "evidence": "Out-of-scope record answered 404 in staging"}

### admin_users.create (the temporary password is returned once)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"full_name": "Trainer N. Newhire", "email": "new.hire@nipuna.test", "scopes": [{"role_code": "TRAINER", "branch_id": 1}]}

### admin_users.grant_scope (temporary access: expires_at at most 7 days ahead)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/users/1/scopes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role_code": "ACADEMIC_COORDINATOR", "branch_id": 1, "expires_at": "2026-10-05T18:00:00+05:30"}

### admin_users.revoke_scope
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/users/1/scopes/1/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Moved back to teaching"}

### admin_users.deactivate
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/users/1/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Left the company"}

### admin_students.search
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/students?q=NIT-STU-2026-004182&activation_status=Activated
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### admin_students.suspend
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/students/1/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Duplicate enrolment under review"}

### crm_sync.list_events (failed events, newest first)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/crm-sync/events?status=Failed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### crm_sync.retry_event
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/crm-sync/events/1/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### audit_log.list (from / to are IST dates)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/audit-log?action=STUDENT_SUSPENDED&from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
